Fruit, nuts, palms, and perennial crops (@farming-orchards: 0, is #trail, #contains @farming-orchard-cycle, #contains @farming-tropical-fruit, #contains @farming-temperate-fruit, #contains @farming-palms-nuts, #contains @farming-drinks) { r_4PGVMHY31EAJNXCSTDSSNB7VSD
Choose climate and mature canopy before buying a tree. First-production ranges below mean small initial crops, not full yield; seedling trees often take substantially longer than grafted stock. A perennial planting commits space, water, and care for years.
